(6172438, 911380, 63218, '<td valign="top">o my. outre. violates all my expectations, amazes &amp; rivets my gaze. Well done!</td>', 'o my. outre. violates all my expectations, amazes & rivets my gaze. Well done!', '2010-09-27 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172496, 911322, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and shapes.  The diagonal arrangement is pleasing, but the focus seems to be on the reflections, which are rather dark, rather than on the more interesting and better lit actual wings.  Really like the lighting too, and the soft glow on the top pieces.</td>', 'Lovely colors and shapes.  The diagonal arrangement is pleasing, but the focus seems to be on the reflections, which are rather dark, rather than on the more interesting and better lit actual wings.  Really like the lighting too, and the soft glow on the top pieces.', '2010-09-27 03:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172503, 911060, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting.', '2010-09-27 03:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172504, 911281, 96751, '<td valign="top">Clever and whimsical.  Love all the detail and the magical lighting.</td>', 'Clever and whimsical.  Love all the detail and the magical lighting.', '2010-09-27 03:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172505, 911149, 96751, '<td valign="top">Jaime?  Your fairies have gone green!</td>', 'Jaime?  Your fairies have gone green!', '2010-09-27 03:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172558, 911121, 54033, '<td valign="top">What....!!! DNMC</td>', 'What....!!! DNMC', '2010-09-27 06:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172559, 911372, 92577, '<td valign="top">very effective</td>', 'very effective', '2010-09-27 06:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172564, 911231, 47470, '<td valign="top">The water looks perfect for the "transformation" aspect, but the water is also turning part of her legs purple, which makes her look dead.  If you color corrected her legs to make them a more "normal" skin tone, this would have worked better.</td>', 'The water looks perfect for the "transformation" aspect, but the water is also turning part of her legs purple, which makes her look dead.  If you color corrected her legs to make them a more "normal" skin tone, this would have worked better.', '2010-09-27 06:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172565, 911378, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish this were a little more high key/brighter, particularly in the skin tones, to give this a happier, more playful mood.</td>', 'I wish this were a little more high key/brighter, particularly in the skin tones, to give this a happier, more playful mood.', '2010-09-27 06:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172566, 911374, 47470, '<td valign="top">I  love the grain and t he slight blur of the beans, but I wish the hand were a bit farther away from the camera, with the fingers a little more visible, so it would be easier to see that it''s a hand right away.</td>', 'I  love the grain and t he slight blur of the beans, but I wish the hand were a bit farther away from the camera, with the fingers a little more visible, so it would be easier to see that it''s a hand right away.', '2010-09-27 06:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172567, 911406, 47470, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully simple.  I only wish that the text was either all in focus or more out of focus.</td>', 'Wonderfully simple.  I only wish that the text was either all in focus or more out of focus.', '2010-09-27 06:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172569, 911281, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish this had something more.  Maybe a motion-blurred hint of a tiny hat or coat tail from an elf that is running away from the camera?  Something to help the image stand on its own in this challenge without the title.</td>', 'I wish this had something more.  Maybe a motion-blurred hint of a tiny hat or coat tail from an elf that is running away from the camera?  Something to help the image stand on its own in this challenge without the title.', '2010-09-27 06:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172570, 911403, 47470, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is (IR maybe?), but I love it.  Great original, emotional interpretation.</td>', 'I have no idea what this is (IR maybe?), but I love it.  Great original, emotional interpretation.', '2010-09-27 06:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172571, 911352, 47470, '<td valign="top">Lovely moss-covered bench.  It looks like something funny happened in the processing, maybe too much smoothing, then too much sharpening?  There are some artifacts around the eyes, hair, and feathery detail of the costume.</td>', 'Lovely moss-covered bench.  It looks like something funny happened in the processing, maybe too much smoothing, then too much sharpening?  There are some artifacts around the eyes, hair, and feathery detail of the costume.', '2010-09-27 06:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172572, 910407, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like such a lovely location.  I wish the light was hitting the tower so it wasn''t in the darkest part of the image.</td>', 'This looks like such a lovely location.  I wish the light was hitting the tower so it wasn''t in the darkest part of the image.', '2010-09-27 06:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172573, 910879, 47470, '<td valign="top">The processing on this enhances the "fairy tale"-ness of the overall image.</td>', 'The processing on this enhances the "fairy tale"-ness of the overall image.', '2010-09-27 06:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172574, 911388, 47470, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to take a picture of a toy/statue/figurine and make it look real and professional.  This is one of the better images with this kind of subject matter that I''ve seen.  The colors and the bokeh make this image so much better.  Well done.</td>', 'It''s difficult to take a picture of a toy/statue/figurine and make it look real and professional.  This is one of the better images with this kind of subject matter that I''ve seen.  The colors and the bokeh make this image so much better.  Well done.', '2010-09-27 06:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172575, 910890, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure about the sun flowers, but I love the action and the blur.  They add an edge to the image that helps convey "fairy tale" (which were originally very dark and anxious stories).</td>', 'I''m not so sure about the sun flowers, but I love the action and the blur.  They add an edge to the image that helps convey "fairy tale" (which were originally very dark and anxious stories).', '2010-09-27 07:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172580, 911304, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and background bokeh.  The highlights are still slightly cyan (on my monitor, at least), so I wish the overall image was a bit warmer.</td>', 'Nice lighting and background bokeh.  The highlights are still slightly cyan (on my monitor, at least), so I wish the overall image was a bit warmer.', '2010-09-27 07:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172582, 911361, 47470, '<td valign="top">The colors, depth of field, and processing definitely have a "fairy tale" feeling to them, but since fairy tales always talk about people and how they interact with these magical objects, I wish there was some human element in this.  I still really like the image anyway.</td>', 'The colors, depth of field, and processing definitely have a "fairy tale" feeling to them, but since fairy tales always talk about people and how they interact with these magical objects, I wish there was some human element in this.  I still really like the image anyway.', '2010-09-27 07:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172585, 911394, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the expression fits.  Alice was never particularly happy in the story.  She was usually surprised, confused, upset, or lost, so I would have preferred an expression that matched one of those emotions instead.</td>', 'I don''t think the expression fits.  Alice was never particularly happy in the story.  She was usually surprised, confused, upset, or lost, so I would have preferred an expression that matched one of those emotions instead.', '2010-09-27 07:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172586, 911244, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this image could stand on its own in this challenge without the title.  Maybe if you had added a small girl or even a shaggy grey dog/wolf?</td>', 'I don''t think this image could stand on its own in this challenge without the title.  Maybe if you had added a small girl or even a shaggy grey dog/wolf?', '2010-09-27 07:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172623, 911386, 40391, '<td valign="top">A beatufil photo with great capture of light.</td>', 'A beatufil photo with great capture of light.', '2010-09-27 09:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172625, 911231, 40391, '<td valign="top">Clever with great editing! The contrasting legs with the lovely blues works very well.</td>', 'Clever with great editing! The contrasting legs with the lovely blues works very well.', '2010-09-27 09:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172626, 911261, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great location beatifully captured</td>', 'Great location beatifully captured', '2010-09-27 09:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172628, 911396, 40391, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Is the frog alive?  The DoF and desat of the background work very well.</td>', 'Excellent! Is the frog alive?  The DoF and desat of the background work very well.', '2010-09-27 09:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172631, 911270, 40391, '<td valign="top">You''ve gone to a lot of work and have done very well. That, or some special occasion has fallen at the right time for you. Either way I like!</td>', 'You''ve gone to a lot of work and have done very well. That, or some special occasion has fallen at the right time for you. Either way I like!', '2010-09-27 09:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172636, 911403, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m only early into voting and have seen some fun shots. this is not one of them.  This is, well, something special! No, special does not explain how this makes me feel.  This goes beyong just a challenge entry but into the realm of pure art.  This gets a 10, a Fav, and a thanks for giving me something wonderful to look at.</td>', 'I''m only early into voting and have seen some fun shots. this is not one of them.  This is, well, something special! No, special does not explain how this makes me feel.  This goes beyong just a challenge entry but into the realm of pure art.  This gets a 10, a Fav, and a thanks for giving me something wonderful to look at.', '2010-09-27 09:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172638, 911392, 40391, '<td valign="top">I always appreciate the humorous shots.</td>', 'I always appreciate the humorous shots.', '2010-09-27 09:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172645, 911267, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like to remove the head, the swirling cloud went a bit overboard.  :)</td>', 'Looks like to remove the head, the swirling cloud went a bit overboard.  :)', '2010-09-27 09:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172646, 911378, 40391, '<td valign="top">She would have to be the fairest, surely!  Great capture.</td>', 'She would have to be the fairest, surely!  Great capture.', '2010-09-27 09:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172647, 911086, 40391, '<td valign="top">Good choice with the overexposure and the nails are a great touch.  Overall - love it!!</td>', 'Good choice with the overexposure and the nails are a great touch.  Overall - love it!!', '2010-09-27 09:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172648, 911383, 15711, '<td valign="top">I looked up the story, with which I was unfamiliar, and indeed this is a perfect depiction.</td>', 'I looked up the story, with which I was unfamiliar, and indeed this is a perfect depiction.', '2010-09-27 09:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172650, 911386, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve never heard of that one but this certainly conjures up Little Red Riding Hood.  The mood and the light really work.  So far, the best one I''ve seen. 9</td>', 'I''ve never heard of that one but this certainly conjures up Little Red Riding Hood.  The mood and the light really work.  So far, the best one I''ve seen. 9', '2010-09-27 09:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172651, 911149, 15711, '<td valign="top">CUTE.  It popped up and I smiled.  Isn''t that what fairies do?  7</td>', 'CUTE.  It popped up and I smiled.  Isn''t that what fairies do?  7', '2010-09-27 09:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172653, 911373, 15711, '<td valign="top">A modern day take that works. :) 7</td>', 'A modern day take that works. :) 7', '2010-09-27 09:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172655, 911406, 15711, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHA  That''s great.  I''m curious if this refers to a fairy tale or not.  I still like it.</td>', 'HAHAHAHA  That''s great.  I''m curious if this refers to a fairy tale or not.  I still like it.', '2010-09-27 09:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172659, 910890, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great depiction of the classic tale.  I like her sense of urgency.  The yellow flowers really ground it.  Your perspective is from a gnome hiding in the woods. :) 8</td>', 'Great depiction of the classic tale.  I like her sense of urgency.  The yellow flowers really ground it.  Your perspective is from a gnome hiding in the woods. :) 8', '2010-09-27 09:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172661, 911361, 15711, '<td valign="top">There is NOTHING about this that I don''t adore.  Please offer this on canvas.  I''d buy it.  Just superb.  The colors and dreamlike quality are a perfect setting for a mystical tale.  10 10 10</td>', 'There is NOTHING about this that I don''t adore.  Please offer this on canvas.  I''d buy it.  Just superb.  The colors and dreamlike quality are a perfect setting for a mystical tale.  10 10 10', '2010-09-27 09:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172662, 911304, 15711, '<td valign="top">CUTE!!!!!!</td>', 'CUTE!!!!!!', '2010-09-27 09:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172668, 911342, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice location but great shot! Well done.</td>', 'Nice location but great shot! Well done.', '2010-09-27 09:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172672, 911408, 40391, '<td valign="top">Remind me to take a similar photo of a church with the same title (personal opinion).  Great idea and well taken.</td>', 'Remind me to take a similar photo of a church with the same title (personal opinion).  Great idea and well taken.', '2010-09-27 09:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
