(6172813, 911277, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and makeup.  Really like the idea.  I think sparkling powder eyeshadow or glitter may have made for better pixie dust by giving it more dimension and presence.  The blurred portions of the powder you used look like water spots on the model.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and makeup.  Really like the idea.  I think sparkling powder eyeshadow or glitter may have made for better pixie dust by giving it more dimension and presence.  The blurred portions of the powder you used look like water spots on the model.', '2010-09-27 12:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172814, 911403, 96751, '<td valign="top">Or alien abduction launch pad...  Phenomenal!  He''s like a hot pixel in a sea of conformist pixels, or a beacon, calling to others who like him, dare walk upright rather than grovel with the masses.  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ubique</a>?<br/> <br/>Dang.  Just brilliant.</td>', 'Or alien abduction launch pad...  Phenomenal!  He''s like a hot pixel in a sea of conformist pixels, or a beacon, calling to others who like him, dare walk upright rather than grovel with the masses.   Ubique? Dang.  Just brilliant.', '2010-09-27 12:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172815, 911360, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!!  That''s one scary pea.  Great idea and adorable child.  Wish there was just a bit more lighting to give it a dreaminess and a tad more contrast.</td>', 'LOL!!!!  That''s one scary pea.  Great idea and adorable child.  Wish there was just a bit more lighting to give it a dreaminess and a tad more contrast.', '2010-09-27 12:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172817, 911372, 96751, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like animation!  Bizarre, exotic, and more Twilight Zone that fairy tale :-)</td>', 'This almost looks like animation!  Bizarre, exotic, and more Twilight Zone that fairy tale :-)', '2010-09-27 12:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172819, 911406, 96751, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at its best.  Great concept image, incredible complementary colors (pale lavender/pink and gray, with a touch of golden yellow!).  I''m not sure when Alice in Wonderland became a fairy tale... but great reference and execution.</td>', 'Simplicity at its best.  Great concept image, incredible complementary colors (pale lavender/pink and gray, with a touch of golden yellow!).  I''m not sure when Alice in Wonderland became a fairy tale... but great reference and execution.', '2010-09-27 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172820, 911231, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous concept, with just enough of the legs to send home the idea.  Well done.  Terrific lighting too, I''m wondering if you were just lucky with the sun, or you brought your own portable one :-)</td>', 'Fabulous concept, with just enough of the legs to send home the idea.  Well done.  Terrific lighting too, I''m wondering if you were just lucky with the sun, or you brought your own portable one :-)', '2010-09-27 12:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172821, 911408, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredibly sharp reflection~</td>', 'Incredibly sharp reflection~', '2010-09-27 12:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172823, 911385, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous make up.  The details of this image are beautiful, although I always picture hadas much happier and friendlier.</td>', 'Fabulous make up.  The details of this image are beautiful, although I always picture hadas much happier and friendlier.', '2010-09-27 12:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172825, 911373, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  The title really explains the shot.  I''m not sure the heavy sepia works for this image, though.  I also think the wardrobe doesn''t help to sell the idea. Cinderella was either in maid''s clothes (which would require something other than that adorable minidress - and definitely some sort of hair treatment other than gorgeous glam) or princess-wear.  But the lighting is great, and that corner she''s in is a terrific set-up.</td>', 'Love the idea.  The title really explains the shot.  I''m not sure the heavy sepia works for this image, though.  I also think the wardrobe doesn''t help to sell the idea. Cinderella was either in maid''s clothes (which would require something other than that adorable minidress - and definitely some sort of hair treatment other than gorgeous glam) or princess-wear.  But the lighting is great, and that corner she''s in is a terrific set-up.', '2010-09-27 12:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172829, 911342, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is terrific!  Love the moody lighting and the great dof.  You also had a great model, who was able to provide emotional content too.</td>', 'Oh, this is terrific!  Love the moody lighting and the great dof.  You also had a great model, who was able to provide emotional content too.', '2010-09-27 12:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172830, 911394, 96751, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are amazing!  But there is something very plastic about this image, perhaps the overly smoothed skin?  There is also something very vapid about the model''s expression, although the reflection is much more vibrant and life-like.  This almost led me to think they were twins :-)</td>', 'Those eyes are amazing!  But there is something very plastic about this image, perhaps the overly smoothed skin?  There is also something very vapid about the model''s expression, although the reflection is much more vibrant and life-like.  This almost led me to think they were twins :-)', '2010-09-27 12:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172831, 911039, 96751, '<td valign="top">aka Ode to Consumerism!  Wild image!</td>', 'aka Ode to Consumerism!  Wild image!', '2010-09-27 12:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172832, 911352, 96751, '<td valign="top">SO sweet.  Masterfully processed (although I''d like to see a little less green on the bench.  Love her toes, and the fuzz around the wings.  I''m sure she had a good time with this one</td>', 'SO sweet.  Masterfully processed (although I''d like to see a little less green on the bench.  Love her toes, and the fuzz around the wings.  I''m sure she had a good time with this one', '2010-09-27 12:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
