(6172834, 911374, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fun pov!  I love the jagged diagonal the elements create, and the contrasts of light and dark, smooth and textured.</td>', 'Fun pov!  I love the jagged diagonal the elements create, and the contrasts of light and dark, smooth and textured.', '2010-09-27 12:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172837, 911396, 96751, '<td valign="top">OMG, the frog almost looks golden.  How did you EVER get him to wear ANYTHING.  Or is he just stuffed?  Compositionally, I''m wondering if a more centered composition would have been stronger.  The right side is rather empty with nothing to look at, while the curtain in the back has some very strong vertical elements which are just screaming to be centered.</td>', 'OMG, the frog almost looks golden.  How did you EVER get him to wear ANYTHING.  Or is he just stuffed?  Compositionally, I''m wondering if a more centered composition would have been stronger.  The right side is rather empty with nothing to look at, while the curtain in the back has some very strong vertical elements which are just screaming to be centered.', '2010-09-27 12:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172838, 911056, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Great lighting and rich jewel tones - befitting of a princess.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Great lighting and rich jewel tones - befitting of a princess.', '2010-09-27 12:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172839, 911278, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is such a tragic image.  It could be that it''s sleeping, but not likely.  Incredible tonal depth and textures, and the dof really works here.  The lighting is masterful, illuminating and camouflaging, both.</td>', 'This is such a tragic image.  It could be that it''s sleeping, but not likely.  Incredible tonal depth and textures, and the dof really works here.  The lighting is masterful, illuminating and camouflaging, both.', '2010-09-27 12:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172840, 911259, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very <i>disapproving</i> bears.  Hilarius, and very nicely lit.  The little one especially is all, WTF???</td>', 'Very disapproving bears.  Hilarius, and very nicely lit.  The little one especially is all, WTF???', '2010-09-27 12:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172841, 911380, 96751, '<td valign="top">What an intriguing and surreal image.  Something lurking in the depths of a burlap sack.  Is it a fairy?  Is it an ogre?  Shall I get closer and risk being eaten?  I think so.  It''s Thumbelina, and even if she was carnivorous, it would only be a tiny bite.<br/> <br/>Good God, I''m rambling....</td>', 'What an intriguing and surreal image.  Something lurking in the depths of a burlap sack.  Is it a fairy?  Is it an ogre?  Shall I get closer and risk being eaten?  I think so.  It''s Thumbelina, and even if she was carnivorous, it would only be a tiny bite. Good God, I''m rambling....', '2010-09-27 12:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172843, 911086, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wicked and wild.  Very cool abstract.  Great use of high contrast.</td>', 'Wicked and wild.  Very cool abstract.  Great use of high contrast.', '2010-09-27 12:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
