(6172845, 911390, 96751, '<td valign="top">This image works MUCH better in Fairy Tale than in High Key.  An incredible location, and I love the dreaminess of the processing, but having the upper and the bottom portions of the image in different tones of gray doesn''t work for me.  I like the greenish hue of the bottom half better than the violet tone above.  Marvelous detail.</td>', 'This image works MUCH better in Fairy Tale than in High Key.  An incredible location, and I love the dreaminess of the processing, but having the upper and the bottom portions of the image in different tones of gray doesn''t work for me.  I like the greenish hue of the bottom half better than the violet tone above.  Marvelous detail.', '2010-09-27 12:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6172846, 911361, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness.  This is so <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5112" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ursula</a> to me.  Breathtaking movement and colors, exquisitely processed.  A fave.</td>', 'Oh my goodness.  This is so  Ursula to me.  Breathtaking movement and colors, exquisitely processed.  A fave.', '2010-09-27 12:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
