(6172875, 910953, 96751, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is so magnificent, as is the pastoral setting.  But that''s mostly what I see here, a pastoral setting.  The ducks are a gorgeous element in it, but they are not the subject.  Even just cropping it a bit tighter would have given them more prominence in the image.</td>', 'The lighting here is so magnificent, as is the pastoral setting.  But that''s mostly what I see here, a pastoral setting.  The ducks are a gorgeous element in it, but they are not the subject.  Even just cropping it a bit tighter would have given them more prominence in the image.', '2010-09-27 13:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
