(6172889, 911192, 96751, '<td valign="top">What sort of fairy tales were YOU told as a kid!!!??<br/> <br/>Very painterly!  Beautifully lit, with a touch of surrealism, and ominous-ness(?)!I love that you''ve used some sort of mannequins to create the figures, and wonder about the enigma of the KKK member on the left.  This amount of work and excellence resembles the mark of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114969" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gyaban</a>, though I know it''s not him (he''s busy in another image :-)<br/> <br/>Would love to know where you shot this, and how you got permission!</td>', 'What sort of fairy tales were YOU told as a kid!!!?? Very painterly!  Beautifully lit, with a touch of surrealism, and ominous-ness(?)!I love that you''ve used some sort of mannequins to create the figures, and wonder about the enigma of the KKK member on the left.  This amount of work and excellence resembles the mark of  gyaban, though I know it''s not him (he''s busy in another image :-) Would love to know where you shot this, and how you got permission!', '2010-09-27 13:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
