(6173007, 911304, 103032, '<td valign="top">Eeewww, I can''t believe you made the model kiss the frog:)  But seriously though, this is a great shot for the challenge.  Like the bokeh, nice lighting. Totally a fairy tale image.  (You owe the model big time!!!)</td>', 'Eeewww, I can''t believe you made the model kiss the frog:)  But seriously though, this is a great shot for the challenge.  Like the bokeh, nice lighting. Totally a fairy tale image.  (You owe the model big time!!!)', '2010-09-27 16:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6173011, 910908, 113419, '<td valign="top">LOVE THIS!</td>', 'LOVE THIS!', '2010-09-27 16:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6173016, 911403, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this. Even before reading the title, I knew what I was looking at. You''ve managed to capture the element of human isolation and the feeling of power radiating within the circle. Well done, and very creative.</td>', 'I really, really like this. Even before reading the title, I knew what I was looking at. You''ve managed to capture the element of human isolation and the feeling of power radiating within the circle. Well done, and very creative.', '2010-09-27 17:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6173018, 911086, 113419, '<td valign="top">very, shall we say, evil looking!  the black fingernails and lips alongside the blown out skin, that alone would have done it but then to have nails in the apple!  genius!  If it were up to me you would have the blue!</td>', 'very, shall we say, evil looking!  the black fingernails and lips alongside the blown out skin, that alone would have done it but then to have nails in the apple!  genius!  If it were up to me you would have the blue!', '2010-09-27 17:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
