(6173500, 911361, 30364, '<td valign="top">My top pick for this challenge.<br/>- It''s a relief from all the banal faeries, pixies and butterflies.<br/>- It inspires me to construct my own fairy tale.<br/>- It reassures me that the photographer has vision.<br/>- It''s really quite beautiful, both within and without the context.<br/>Thank you.</td>', 'My top pick for this challenge.- It''s a relief from all the banal faeries, pixies and butterflies.- It inspires me to construct my own fairy tale.- It reassures me that the photographer has vision.- It''s really quite beautiful, both within and without the context.Thank you.', '2010-09-28 10:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6173527, 911344, 119040, '<td valign="top">what the flash?</td>', 'what the flash?', '2010-09-28 11:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
