(6174017, 911378, 69246, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Perfect smile. Good pose. Not the classical fairy tale as one would expect, but never the less still fully meets the challenge for a modern day young princess. Very nice, one of my top votes.</td>', 'Very cute. Perfect smile. Good pose. Not the classical fairy tale as one would expect, but never the less still fully meets the challenge for a modern day young princess. Very nice, one of my top votes.', '2010-09-28 22:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174018, 911396, 69246, '<td valign="top">I''m not the first to ask, is it a real frog, if so how did you get it to stay? Very nicely done!</td>', 'I''m not the first to ask, is it a real frog, if so how did you get it to stay? Very nicely done!', '2010-09-28 22:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174019, 911394, 69246, '<td valign="top">Of all the portraits with makeup, this is the best because of the angle and use of the mirror. Nicely done.</td>', 'Of all the portraits with makeup, this is the best because of the angle and use of the mirror. Nicely done.', '2010-09-28 22:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174020, 911362, 69246, '<td valign="top">This could have been a little lighter and left a little, not a lot, more red in the apple.</td>', 'This could have been a little lighter and left a little, not a lot, more red in the apple.', '2010-09-28 22:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174027, 911270, 117955, '<td valign="top">Oh, Boy! What fun!I love everything about this!</td>', 'Oh, Boy! What fun!I love everything about this!', '2010-09-28 23:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174029, 911361, 7810, '<td valign="top">Nice work Ursula</td>', 'Nice work Ursula', '2010-09-28 23:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174031, 911261, 117955, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow! How neat. Lovely light &amp; very fairy tale-ish!</td>', 'Oh, wow! How neat. Lovely light & very fairy tale-ish!', '2010-09-28 23:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174032, 911361, 117955, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color; looks like a painting.</td>', 'Beautiful color; looks like a painting.', '2010-09-28 23:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174033, 911192, 117955, '<td valign="top">Cool! Great composition &amp; the light is great!</td>', 'Cool! Great composition & the light is great!', '2010-09-28 23:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174035, 911322, 117955, '<td valign="top">I really like the muted tones of this, and the reflection is very nice.</td>', 'I really like the muted tones of this, and the reflection is very nice.', '2010-09-28 23:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174036, 911369, 117955, '<td valign="top">This is lovely! I like the comp &amp; dark background. Really makes the subject stand out.</td>', 'This is lovely! I like the comp & dark background. Really makes the subject stand out.', '2010-09-28 23:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174037, 911342, 117955, '<td valign="top">Very creative! Like it a lot - she has great expression. I might have used a different color on her dress to contrast more with the grass, but still really like it.</td>', 'Very creative! Like it a lot - she has great expression. I might have used a different color on her dress to contrast more with the grass, but still really like it.', '2010-09-28 23:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174038, 911396, 117955, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love it! I applaud your creativity! The light is really good, and I love the gold pillow and red cape!</td>', 'Absolutely love it! I applaud your creativity! The light is really good, and I love the gold pillow and red cape!', '2010-09-28 23:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174039, 911385, 117955, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The light on her face is wonderful and I really like the composition as well.</td>', 'Beautiful! The light on her face is wonderful and I really like the composition as well.', '2010-09-28 23:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174040, 911231, 117955, '<td valign="top">Very clever. I like that you cannot see the rest of her. And the water is mystical.</td>', 'Very clever. I like that you cannot see the rest of her. And the water is mystical.', '2010-09-28 23:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174041, 910953, 117955, '<td valign="top">I like this one quite a bit. The light is beautiful, and the foreground and background make it seem quite a secluded place.</td>', 'I like this one quite a bit. The light is beautiful, and the foreground and background make it seem quite a secluded place.', '2010-09-28 23:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174042, 910879, 117955, '<td valign="top">How majestic! Makes me think of "Lord of the Rings". I love the great height of the structure and repetitive arches, with the green in the foreground.</td>', 'How majestic! Makes me think of "Lord of the Rings". I love the great height of the structure and repetitive arches, with the green in the foreground.', '2010-09-28 23:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174043, 911304, 117955, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful! I can''t find anything wrong with it!</td>', 'This is just beautiful! I can''t find anything wrong with it!', '2010-09-28 23:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174044, 911329, 117955, '<td valign="top">I think this cat is mystical as well as mythical:) Lovely shot.</td>', 'I think this cat is mystical as well as mythical:) Lovely shot.', '2010-09-28 23:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174045, 911388, 117955, '<td valign="top">So pretty! I like the round red medallions... they add a deal of mystery:)</td>', 'So pretty! I like the round red medallions... they add a deal of mystery:)', '2010-09-28 23:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174046, 911056, 117955, '<td valign="top">Very good composition, not to mention great costume! I really like the way her skin is so pale, but her lips and eyes are accented. Nice work.</td>', 'Very good composition, not to mention great costume! I really like the way her skin is so pale, but her lips and eyes are accented. Nice work.', '2010-09-28 23:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174047, 911249, 117955, '<td valign="top">Fascinating! I love photos of water &amp; the reflections here are just entrancing!</td>', 'Fascinating! I love photos of water & the reflections here are just entrancing!', '2010-09-28 23:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174049, 911360, 117955, '<td valign="top">Great use of baby blankets!!! I like the very soft light and all the pink! Her expression is perfect, as well.</td>', 'Great use of baby blankets!!! I like the very soft light and all the pink! Her expression is perfect, as well.', '2010-09-28 23:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174050, 911296, 117955, '<td valign="top">Love the colorization here. Like the way the child''s smooth skin is such a contrast to all the other textures going on.</td>', 'Love the colorization here. Like the way the child''s smooth skin is such a contrast to all the other textures going on.', '2010-09-28 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174051, 910407, 117955, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here, with the tower far off in the distance. Lovely.</td>', 'I really like the composition here, with the tower far off in the distance. Lovely.', '2010-09-28 23:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174052, 911149, 117955, '<td valign="top">Gosh, this is just so whimsical! I''m normally not a fan of whimsy, but when your challenge is "fairy tales", this fits the bill to a T.  I love how all of the greenery is softened, and how you have her positioned on the rocks. Great expression as well.</td>', 'Gosh, this is just so whimsical! I''m normally not a fan of whimsy, but when your challenge is "fairy tales", this fits the bill to a T.  I love how all of the greenery is softened, and how you have her positioned on the rocks. Great expression as well.', '2010-09-28 23:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174053, 911374, 117955, '<td valign="top">Great concept, and I like the B&amp;W. Only thing I might change is the actual shape or position of the hand... I had to really look at it before I realized that''s what it is. Otherwise, I really like it.</td>', 'Great concept, and I like the B&W. Only thing I might change is the actual shape or position of the hand... I had to really look at it before I realized that''s what it is. Otherwise, I really like it.', '2010-09-28 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174057, 911390, 117955, '<td valign="top">wow... beautiful! I really like the colorization.</td>', 'wow... beautiful! I really like the colorization.', '2010-09-28 23:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174058, 911372, 117955, '<td valign="top">This sort of reminds me of something Maxfield Parrish would have painted! Love it!</td>', 'This sort of reminds me of something Maxfield Parrish would have painted! Love it!', '2010-09-28 23:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174060, 911362, 117955, '<td valign="top">Oh, yes &amp; thank you very much! How dark and wonderful this is! Great job!</td>', 'Oh, yes & thank you very much! How dark and wonderful this is! Great job!', '2010-09-28 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
