(6181076, 911270, 117285, '<td valign="top">Ughh, after having just gone through my first experience and thrill of getting a ribbon I totally feel for you.  But it did get quite a bit of exposure for the short time it was on the top page.  I know you must have enjoyed the experience even if you were rushed putting it all together.  Next time, at least you''ll have the camera''s date setup properly.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Ughh, after having just gone through my first experience and thrill of getting a ribbon I totally feel for you.  But it did get quite a bit of exposure for the short time it was on the top page.  I know you must have enjoyed the experience even if you were rushed putting it all together.  Next time, at least you''ll have the camera''s date setup properly.  Good Luck.', '2010-10-04 18:19:28.000000', NULL, 0),
