(6203893, 911390, 86447, '<td valign="top">It is generally thought polite and proper to check each comment that you think is helpful... even if they''re helpfully criticizing... just sayin''... so you''ll know.  It thanks the commenter for taking the time to consider your image and talk to you about it.<br/> <br/>That said, I''m really glad you''ve got a ribbon!</td>', 'It is generally thought polite and proper to check each comment that you think is helpful... even if they''re helpfully criticizing... just sayin''... so you''ll know.  It thanks the commenter for taking the time to consider your image and talk to you about it. That said, I''m really glad you''ve got a ribbon!', '2010-10-28 22:17:41.000000', NULL, 0),
